    "question": "<p>Which option figure will replace the question mark in the following series:</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/10/F3_Pooja%2014-10-21_Savita_D11.png\" style=\"width: 402px; height: 82px;\" /></p>\n",
