    "question": "<p>Select the number from among the given options that can replace the question mark (?) in the following series.</p>\n\n<p>0, 7, 26, 63, ?, 215</p>\n",
    "question_hi": "<p>दिए गए विकल्पों में से वह संख्या चुनिए जो निम्नलिखित <span style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 36);   \">शृंखला&nbsp;</span>में प्रश्नवाचक चिन्ह (?) को प्रतिस्थापित कर सके।</p>\n\n<p>0, 7, 26, 63,?, 215</p>\n",
    "options": [
      "216",
      "124",
      "74",
      "80",
      "Question Not Attempted"
    ],
    "options_hi": [
      "216",
      "124",
      "74",
      "80",
      "अनुत्तरित प्रश्न"
    ],
    "correct": 2,
    "solution": "<p><strong>Explanation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>The pattern followed here is n<sup>3&nbsp;</sup>- 1.</p>\n\n<p>1<sup>3&nbsp;</sup>- 1 = 0</p>\n\n<p>2<sup>3&nbsp;</sup>- 1 = 7</p>\n\n<p>3<sup>3&nbsp;</sup>- 1 = 26</p>\n\n<p>4<sup>3&nbsp;</sup>- 1 = 63</p>\n\n<p><strong>5<sup>3&nbsp;</sup>-&nbsp;1 = 124</strong></p>\n\n<p>6<sup>3&nbsp;</sup>- 1 = 215</p>\n\n<p>Hence, <strong>124 </strong>is the correct answer.</p>\n",
    "solution_hi": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">दिया गया है :</span></p>\n\n<p>यहाँ अनुसरित&nbsp;पैटर्न&nbsp;<span style=\"\">n</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">- 1&nbsp;है।</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">1<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">3&nbsp;</span>- 1 = 0</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">2<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">3&nbsp;</span>- 1 = 7</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">3<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">3&nbsp;</span>- 1 = 26</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">4<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">3&nbsp;</span>- 1 = 63</p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">5<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">3&nbsp;</span>-&nbsp;1 = 124</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">6<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">3&nbsp;</span>- 1 = 215</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">अत:,&nbsp;<strong>124</strong> सही उत्तर है।</p>\n",
    "marks": "0.97"
  },
