    "solution": "<p style=\"\">Given :-&nbsp;<span style=\"\">_ BCD _ _ ABC _ _ E _ BC _ _ _ ABC_ DE</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">By checking options and substituting accordingly.</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">1)&nbsp;<span style=\"\">AADEDDDDED&nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp;<strong>A</strong>&nbsp;B C D&nbsp;<strong>A D</strong>&nbsp;- A B C&nbsp;<strong>E D</strong>&nbsp;E -&nbsp;<strong>D</strong>&nbsp;B C&nbsp;<strong>D D E</strong>&nbsp;- A B C&nbsp;<strong>D</strong>&nbsp;D E</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">2)&nbsp;<span style=\"\">ADEADDEDDD&nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp;<strong>A</strong>&nbsp;B C D&nbsp;<strong>D E -&nbsp;</strong>A B C&nbsp;<strong>A D</strong>&nbsp;E -&nbsp;<strong>D</strong>&nbsp;B C&nbsp;<strong>E D D</strong>&nbsp;- A B C&nbsp;<strong>D</strong>&nbsp;D E</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><strong>3)&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"\"><strong>ADEDDADDED&nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp;A</strong>&nbsp;B C D&nbsp;<strong>D E</strong>&nbsp;- A B C&nbsp;<strong>D D&nbsp;</strong>E -&nbsp;<strong>A</strong>&nbsp;B C&nbsp;<strong>D D E</strong>&nbsp;- A B C&nbsp;<strong>D</strong>&nbsp;D E</span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li style=\"\"><span style=\"\">Here <strong>&quot;</strong><strong>A B C D D E&quot;&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;is repeated.</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"\">4)&nbsp;<span style=\"\">ADDADDEDDE&nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp;<strong>A</strong>&nbsp;B C D&nbsp;<strong>D D -&nbsp;</strong>A B C&nbsp;<strong>A D&nbsp;</strong>E -&nbsp;<strong>D</strong>&nbsp;B C&nbsp;<strong>E D D</strong>&nbsp;- A B C&nbsp;<strong>E</strong>&nbsp;D E</span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li style=\"\"><span style=\"\">Option (3) gives the pattern of :-<strong>&nbsp;</strong></span><strong><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">A</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;B C D&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">D E</span></strong><span style=\"\">&nbsp;- A B C</span>&nbsp;D D&nbsp;E -&nbsp;<strong>A&nbsp;B C&nbsp;D D E</strong>&nbsp;- A B C&nbsp;D&nbsp;D E.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Hence, the correct answer is <strong>&quot;ADEDDADDED&quot;.</str